{"id":"n24004-1-8","stage":4,"title":"광장 · 广场","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24004-1-8-1","ko":"아빠, 우리 자전거 타러 가요.","zh":"爸爸，我们一起去骑自行车吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠,","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자전거","meaning":"自行车","explanation":"자전거：自行车","readings":[{"term":"자전거","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62517","senseId":"1","lemma":"자전거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타러","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"91e88e6f412fe193","term":"자전거","zh":"自行车","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3","entryId":"62517","definition":"人的座驾，用两只脚踩使轮胎转动前进。","pronunciation":["자전거"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bb7964a5b8c2365334de.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24004-1-8-2","ko":"그러자꾸나. 자전거로 광장을 한 바퀴 돌고 오자.","zh":"好啊。那就骑自行车绕着广场转一圈再回来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러자꾸나.","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；자꾸나：向晚辈或亲近的人提出一起行动的建议。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자전거로","meaning":"自行车","explanation":"자전거：自行车；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"자전거","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62517","senseId":"1","lemma":"자전거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"광장을","meaning":"广场","explanation":"광장：广场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"광장","audio":"/audio/afbb411c2c9e3884febd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24004","senseId":"1","lemma":"광장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바퀴","meaning":"圈，周","explanation":"바퀴：圈，周","readings":[{"term":"바퀴","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15819","senseId":"1","lemma":"바퀴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌고","meaning":"转，转圈","explanation":"돌다：转，转圈；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"16","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오자.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"91e88e6f412fe193","term":"자전거","zh":"自行车","audio":"/audio/91e88e6f412fe193a0f1.mp3","entryId":"62517","definition":"人的座驾，用两只脚踩使轮胎转动前进。","pronunciation":["자전거"]},{"id":"afbb411c2c9e3884","term":"광장","zh":"广场","audio":"/audio/afbb411c2c9e3884febd.mp3","entryId":"24004","definition":"位于城市中央，有很多人聚集的宽敞的地方。","pronunciation":["광ː장"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"c8e16f13560a8ff4","term":"바퀴","zh":"圈，周","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3","entryId":"15819","definition":"计算画圈一样绕着一个圆形转动次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["바퀴"]},{"id":"2dc53ba2c5ff682d","term":"돌다","zh":"转，转圈","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3","entryId":"75006","definition":"沿着某个场所的边缘移动。","pronunciation":["돌ː다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5b65c303903bf4cad8e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.949,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24004","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6743,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。那就骑自行车绕着广场转一圈再回来吧。","爸爸，我们一起去骑自行车吧。","你吃炒年糕怎么会流这么多汗啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爸爸，我们一起去骑自行车吧。","你吃炒年糕怎么会流这么多汗啊？","好啊。那就骑自行车绕着广场转一圈再回来吧。"],"answer":2}]}
